{"id":527,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自主自律と探究心を育てる筑波大附属中","feature_description":"筑波大学附属中学校は、筑波大学の附属校として中等普通教育を行い、大学の教育研究への協力と学生の教育実習を担います。校訓は「強く、正しく、朗らかに」。調和的な心身の発達、確かな知性、豊かな個性を育み、民主的社会の一員として主体的に人生を開拓する人間を教育目標に掲げます。自主自律、探究心、広い視野での判断、集団での協力と責任も育てる資質として示しています。","clubs":[{"id":10383,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.high-s.tsukuba.ac.jp/jhs/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":10384,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.high-s.tsukuba.ac.jp/jhs/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":10385,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.high-s.tsukuba.ac.jp/jhs/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14559,"name":"男子水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.high-s.tsukuba.ac.jp/jhs/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14560,"name":"女子水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.high-s.tsukuba.ac.jp/jhs/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14561,"name":"蹴球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.high-s.tsukuba.ac.jp/jhs/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14562,"name":"男子硬式庭球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.high-s.tsukuba.ac.jp/jhs/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14563,"name":"女子硬式庭球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.high-s.tsukuba.ac.jp/jhs/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14564,"name":"排球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.high-s.tsukuba.ac.jp/jhs/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14565,"name":"男子籠球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.high-s.tsukuba.ac.jp/jhs/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14566,"name":"女子籠球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.high-s.tsukuba.ac.jp/jhs/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14567,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.high-s.tsukuba.ac.jp/jhs/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14568,"nam